From 4eac1306e1074ca5c0fb09847ef5f89907a20867 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mathias Preiner <mathias.preiner@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 16:25:48 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] node/type: Introduce reference counting for
 NodeManager/TypeManager.

Defers destruction of NodeManager/TypeManager until all data referencing
them is freed. This prevents premature destruction of
NodeManager/TypeManager when Node/Type objects are still live.

Fixes #184.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
